# gifenc 1.0.3 and its predecessors

Main code: Copyright (c) 2017 Matt DesLauriers; see gifenc-LICENSE
(named LICENSE in the source package).
PnnQuant-derived src/pnnquant2.js: MPL-2.0; see PnnQuant-MPL-2.0
(named MPL-2.0 in the source package).
Readable sources, licenses and build instructions are supplied separately as
gifenc-1.0.3-sources.zip. The HTML Licenses window shows its exact SHA-256 and
configured download URL. On disk: sources/gifenc-1.0.3/. Before public release,
provide this corresponding source ZIP with clear download directions; a local
build with an unconfigured URL is not a completed public distribution setup.

